<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells further 7.695 bln bfr of OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells further 7.695 bln bfr of OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of linear bond (OLO) sales volume at its non-competitive OLO auction - (in billions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Bond line		March 2001	March 2007</p>
<p>Grand total</p>
<p>    Competitive auction   5.709	    12.015</p>
<p>    Non-comp.   auction   3.000	     4.695</p>
<p>    Total		     8.709	    16.710</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
